* end of insertion 140321

    FORMAT COLOR COL_NORMAL INTENSIFIED OFF.
    WRITE: / sy-vline NO-GAP,
             etab-qsskz NO-GAP, sy-vline NO-GAP,
*             t059q-qscod no-gap, sy-vline no-gap, " Delete 140321
