                  sy-vline NO-GAP.

    AT LAST.
      IF count2 > 1.
        SUM.
        ULINE.
        FORMAT COLOR COL_TOTAL INTENSIFIED.
        WRITE: /1(1) sy-vline,
                 '*****      ',
